# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: The Swarm Grows (1145, 1146), Helcular's Revenge (553), Silky Sutures (97539).
# Left out: Regthar Deathgate (1361), To Steal From Thieves (1164).

# Horde 30-40 in the order the zones' quest levels fit (2026-11-07 re-order): Hillsbrad and
# a first Arathi pass at 30-33, the Shimmering Flats and Desolace at 33-36, Stranglethorn at
# 36-37, Dustwallow at 37-38, Alterac and Arathi at 38-39, the Badlands at 39-40. Before it,
# Desolace came first at 30 with three of its quest hubs two to five levels over, and the
# guide topped up to 32-33 at Sargeron and the coast.
#
# Flow: Freewind Post (where the previous guide ends) -> fly to the Crossroads (Korran) ->
# Orgrimmar (Alliance Relations, Belgrom, training) -> zeppelin to the Undercity -> fly to Tarren Mill (bind) -> Valik and the Syndicate camps -> the yeti caves ->
# Hillsbrad's town hall -> Tarren Mill -> the Foothill Caverns' flames -> the Dalaran crater ->
# the Azurelode Mine -> Southshore's graveyard (and the coast, for Elixir of Agony) -> Tarren
# Mill -> east into Arathi: the Boulderfist camp, Hammerfall (flight path) -> raptors, spiders
# and the Witherbark trolls -> Hammerfall -> fly to the Undercity (training), where the next
# guide takes the Orgrimmar zeppelin.
#
# Saved for the 38-39 visit (forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands): Gol'dir and the
# Perenolde chain (503-508), Dalaran Patrols and Bracers of Binding (545, 557: accepted here), Foul Magics
# (671, accepted here; its Syndicate are by the road in from Tarren Mill), Guile of the Raptor
# (701) and the Stones of Binding.
# Key to the City (93680) comes along with Prison Break In: Voidglare offers Dalaran Patrols right after
# it (players' recordings, the refusal gate's hand-in-first step).
#
# Left out: To Steal From Thieves (1164): Genavie Callow offers it in the Undercity at 30, three
# levels before the Dabyrie family (33-35) fit, and the route does not come back to the
# Undercity after the 38-39 Arathi visit.
#
# Optional extras:
# - Elixir of Agony (515, 517, 524): needs a Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir (item 3388; the quest
#   text says Strong, the objective takes the Lesser one), an Alchemy item no vendor sells.
#   Without one, skip the whole chain.
#
# Class quests and training:
# - Druids train in Thunder Bluff on the flight from Freewind Post; Paladins with Garen Largo in
#   the Undercity; everyone else in Orgrimmar. At about 32-33, the Undercity at the end of the
#   guide trains Warriors, Paladins, Rogues, Priests, Mages and Warlocks; Hunters, Shamans and
#   Druids train at the start of the next guide.
# - Shaman: Call of Water (220) goes to Islen Waterseer by Ratchet on the way, the Brazier of
#   Everfount from the Undercity (Silverpine, the Sepulcher), and the Shard of Water back to
#   Islen in the next guide. Call of Air (1531) is offered from level 30: Searn Firewarder gives
#   it on the next guide's Orgrimmar stop (about 31.7), not on this one's (29.4), and Prate
#   Cloudseer by Freewind Post takes it later in that guide.
# - Warlock: the Felhunter chain is forever/class/warlock/felhunter-horde.
#
# Skyborne: Exploring the Horde (93739) is handed to Thrall on the Orgrimmar stop, optional.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Orgrimmar

step Freewind Post flight master
  zone Thousand Needles
  goto 45.0,49.1 "Freewind Post flight master"

step Thunder Bluff
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Fly from Freewind Post to Thunder Bluff and train with Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise; fly on to the Crossroads from there.
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  train class

step Ratchet
  only Shaman
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly from Freewind Post to Ratchet. Islen Waterseer camps on the coast a short walk south of the town; fly on to the Crossroads from Ratchet.
  fly "Ratchet"
  turnin 220 reward 6637              -- Islen Waterseer: your Water Sapta, for the brazier
  accept 63

step Fly to the Crossroads
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  goto 46.7,49.9 "Thunder Bluff flight master"
  fly "Crossroads"
  zone The Barrens

step Fly to the Crossroads
  only Shaman
  zone The Barrens
  goto 63.1,37.1 "Ratchet flight master"
  fly "Crossroads"

step Fly to the Crossroads
  only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Paladin,Mage,Warlock
  zone Thousand Needles
  fly "Crossroads"
  zone The Barrens

step Korran
  zone The Barrens
  tip Korran stands beside the Crossroads flight master.
  accept 1145                         -- Korran: for Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar

step Fly to Orgrimmar
  zone The Barrens
  goto 51.5,30.4 "Crossroads flight master"
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  zone Orgrimmar

