# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Undercity

step The Undercity
  zone Undercity
  tip Elixir of Agony needs a Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir, an Alchemy item: buy one at the auction house if you can (or ask an alchemist). The quest text says Strong, but it takes a Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir. No elixir: skip the Elixir steps in Hillsbrad.
  note Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir: auction house or an alchemist, for Elixir of Agony.

step Garen Largo
  only Paladin
  zone Undercity
  tip Garen Largo trains Paladins in the Undercity.
  train class

step Undercity flight master
  only Shaman
  zone Undercity
  goto 63.1,48.3 "Undercity flight master"

step Brazier of Everfount
  only Shaman
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Fly to the Sepulcher. The Brazier of Everfount stands on the hill just south-west of it: beat the Corrupt Manifestation of Water beside it, place its bracers in the brazier, speak to the Minor Manifestation of Water and keep the Shard of Water for Islen. Fly on to Tarren Mill from the Sepulcher.
  fly "The Sepulcher"
  use 6637 quest 63.1 @38.5,44.4 map 1421 -- Water Sapta: drink it by the standing stone to see the elemental
  collect 7812 quest 63.1
  turnin 63                           -- Brazier of Everfount
  accept 100
  turnin 100                          -- Minor Manifestation of Water
  accept 96                           -- for Islen Waterseer, next guide

step Fly to Tarren Mill
  only Shaman
  zone Silverpine Forest
  goto 45.6,42.4 "The Sepulcher flight master"
