step Level 30
  when level<30
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Tarren Mill's Prison Break In, Stone Tokens and The Hammer May Fall are offered from level 30. Below it? Keep killing the yetis in these caves until level 30. Or, with a group, run the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Graveyard) or the Blackfathom Deeps dungeon instead.
  goto 44.0,28.0 map 1424 "Foothill Caverns"
  level 30 grind 2248                 -- grind on Cave Yeti

