  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip On to Hillsbrad town, south-west of the yeti caves. The town hall is on the town's west side: Magistrate Burnside (30) and Clerk Horrace Whitesteed are inside with the Town Registry; the Proclamation is pinned up beside it. Councilmen walk the town.
