# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The flames, Dalaran, the mine

step Foothill Caverns
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Back into the yeti caves west of Tarren Mill with the Rod of Helcular. The path splits just inside: the Flame of Azel burns on the upper level to the right, the Flame of Veraz on the lower level to the left, past more yetis.
  use 3710 quest 553.1 @43.9,28.1 map 1424 -- Flame of Azel
  use 3710 quest 553.2 @44.1,26.6 map 1424 -- Flame of Veraz

step Flame of Uzel
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip The third flame burns in the smaller cave up in the hills north of the caverns.
  use 3710 quest 553.3 @41.7,6.4 map 1424 -- Flame of Uzel

step Alterac Mountains
  zone Alterac Mountains
  goto 20.2,84.3 "The Dalaran crater"

step The Dalaran crater
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Head west along the foot of the mountains to the violet dome of Dalaran. Ricter, Alina and Dermot (33-34) stand together inside the crater's eastern rim, Kegan Darkmar (35) a little west of them; each carries one Bloodstone piece. The Shield Guards and Theurgists (31-33) around them drop the Worn Stone Tokens. Careful: Many guards stand in linked pairs and others patrol alone around the camp.
  collect 3691 quest 544.1            -- Dermot
  collect 3689 quest 544.2            -- Ricter
  collect 3690 quest 544.3            -- Alina
  collect 3688 quest 544.4            -- Kegan Darkmar
  collect 279469 quest 93680.1 @16.4,89.3 map 1416 -- Grimy Key: an object to loot, by the traitors
  collect 3714 quest 556

