  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  goto 28.5,55.0 "Azurelode Mine"

step Azurelode Mine
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Head south past Hillsbrad town to the Azurelode Mine. Miners work the tunnels; Foreman Bonds (30) and Miner Hackett (29) are deep inside.
  kill 2269 quest 539.2
  kill 2450 quest 567.3
  kill 2305 quest 539.1               -- Inside Azurelode Mine

