# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Into Arathi

step Arathi Highlands
  zone Arathi Highlands
  goto 32.6,40.4 "Boulderfist camp"

step Boulderfist camp
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Head east out of Tarren Mill through Thoradin's Wall and follow the road east. The Boulderfist Ogres and Enforcers (32-34) camp south of the road, south of Northfold Manor; the Enforcers stay in the cave there.
  kill 2562 quest 676.1
  kill 2564 quest 676.2               -- Below ground

step Level 31
  when level<31
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Hammerfall's quests are 32-36. Below 31? Keep killing the Boulderfist Ogres and Enforcers at this camp until level 31. Or, with a group, run the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Graveyard) or the Blackfathom Deeps dungeon instead.
  goto 31.2,48.0 map 1417 "Boulderfist camp"
  level 31 grind 2562                 -- grind on Boulderfist Ogre

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Hammerfall

step Hammerfall
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The orc stronghold at the eastern end of the road. Urda, the wind rider master, stands by the gate.
  tip Rutherford Twing offers the Defiler's Basic Care Package only once you are Friendly with the Defilers (Arathi Basin): skip it if he doesn't offer it.
  accept 655                          -- Gor'mul, by the gate
  getfp "Hammerfall"
  accept 8263 optional                -- Rutherford Twing
  turnin 8263 optional
  turnin 676                          -- Drum Fel
  accept 677
  turnin 655                          -- Tor'gan
  accept 672
  accept 671                          -- Tor'gan: its Syndicate are by the road in from Tarren Mill, on the 38-39 visit
  accept 97539                        -- Doctor Gregory Victor

step Witherbark Village
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip South of Hammerfall, the Witherbark trolls hold the village in the hills. Axe Throwers guard the outer huts; the Witch Doctors and Headhunters hold the heart of the village. Careful: All three troll types flee for help at 15% health, which can pull more trolls from the nearby camps.
  kill 2556 quest 677.2
  kill 2554 quest 677.1
  kill 2555 quest 677.3

step Highland raptors and Plains Creepers
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip On the way back north, Highland Striders roam the hills all around Hammerfall and drop the eyes, and south of it the Plains Creepers (32-33) spin their webs in the grass; they carry the spidersilk.
  collect 4512 quest 672
  collect 278225 quest 97539 @69.5,50.5 map 1417 -- Surgical Spidersilk, from Plains Creepers

